<title>THAILAND: Thai stocks closed for Labour Day holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai stocks closed for Labour Day holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Thailand was closed on Thursday for the Labour Day holiday.</p>
<p>The composite SET index rose 2.70 points to close at 661.29 on 3.5 billion baht turnover on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
